  "description": "Written against real 1920x1080 capture. Regions were measured from frames, not guessed: the wanted-star row and the ammo counter share a corner, and the star row is right-anchored, so its search window is deliberately wider than the glyphs. Signature patterns and fusion rules added 2026-08-19 from on-screen text read out of a real 96-minute recording: with none, game detection could never identify GTA and every recording of it fell back to the generic profile. The OCR-tolerant spellings are not decoration -- DIRECTOR MODE came back as DIFIECTOR, DINECTOH, DIPECTOR and DRECTOR across 161 readings of the same two words.",
